  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Strengthening Migration Management in Niger - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to strengthen the capacities of the Government of Niger for an integrated management of migration, respectful of human rights and including accompanying the return of migrants to their countries of origin. The project will be implemented in partnership with IOM and in close collaboration with national institutions on the basis of a gradual transfer of skills for the coordination and operational management of migration in order to promote sustainability and appropriation of results. The project will seek in particular to strengthen the capacities of the national authorities&#x2019; members of the migration governance framework responsible for implementing national policies and State commitments and through strategies to support their mandates taking into account their absorption capacities and transfer of responsibility in the implementation of project actions.</narrative>
  </description>
